# The graph itself is tracked — it is what the door tells every agent to ask
# before reading the tree. These three are not: scratch space, one dated full
# copy per run-day, and an HTML rendering of the graph.json beside it.
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/
graphify-out/graph.html
