site/.hugo_build.lock
site/_vendor/
# Agent-harness scratch checkouts. `.claude/skills/` and `.claude/settings.json`
# are multivac's own projection (MV-72, MV-74) and stay tracked; this one is a
# git worktree per subagent, written by the harness and never by this tool. It
# reached 524 MB in one session and shows up as untracked in every status.
.claude/worktrees/
